<p class="mt-4">This is a demo of <a href="https://projectblacklight.org/">Blacklight</a> equiped with semantic search. By using the select dropdown next to the search box, you can select keyword (traditional) or vector (semantic) search.</p>

<p>The indexing is done by text extraction from the source documents and the adding the chunks as child documents to the parent document.
  We currently are revealing the child documents in the UI, but in production we would probably hide them. You can do this by selecting "parent" in the "Format" filter.
  For more information about the indexing pipleine see: <a href="https://github.com/jcoyne/sdr-harvest">https://github.com/jcoyne/sdr-harvest</a></p>
